@startuml US081_SSD
title US081 - Import Flight Plan From File - SSD

actor "Pilot" as Pilot
participant "SEM4PI System" as System

Pilot -> System : request to import flight plan from file
System --> Pilot : request file path

Pilot -> System : provide .dsldig5 file path

alt file invalid (lexical, syntactic, or semantic)
    System --> Pilot : display validation errors
else domain validation fails
    System --> Pilot : display domain error messages
else import successful
    System --> Pilot : display flight plan id (status DRAFT)
end

@enduml
